WEBVTT

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:45.250
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:56.125
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:07.125
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:15.125
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:22.167
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:32.375
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:39.750
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:47.167
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:54.333
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:58.917
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:05.042
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:10.625
Pumpkin lanterns complete!

00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:13.458
They look just like all three of us, huh?

00:02:13.458 --> 00:02:15.708
I'm not at all like this pumpkin!

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:16.917
Gagantous!

00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:18.333
I'm home!

00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:19.583
Welcome back.

00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:22.667
I just bought my Halloween costume.

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:23.875
What did you buy?

00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:25.833
Hm-hm, it's a secret.

00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:29.917
A-ha! Leave it to you, Tsugumi!
Very skillfully done.

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:32.875
Geez, I wish you could be my bride!

00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:36.292
Meme, the lantern you made is pretty cute, too.

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:39.000
Right, Miss Anya?

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:46.417
Miss Anya, your lantern
doesn't have any playfulness, huh?

00:02:46.417 --> 00:02:47.875
It's scary <i>and </i>disgusting.

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:51.375
Miss Tsugumi, you said to make
a spook head out of the pumpkin!

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:54.000
What part of <i>that </i>is supposed to be a spook?!

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.750
Want to put a ribbon on it?

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:57.958
Hmph!

00:02:57.958 --> 00:02:59.750
I knew it.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:00.708
All right.

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:02.542
You will?

00:03:02.542 --> 00:03:03.542
Yes?

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:05.292
Do you have a red one?

00:03:05.292 --> 00:03:06.750
Huh?

00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:09.667
A letter for you, Tsugumi.

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:12.083
Ah, thank you very much.

00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:13.833
It's from my mom!

00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:15.583
Miss Kana, you're still a child;

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:18.542
you're going to go around
getting Halloween candy, right?

00:03:20.542 --> 00:03:22.167
That's a real...

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:23.417
...monster!

00:03:23.417 --> 00:03:24.500
Hey!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.083
Evil spirits be banished!

00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:28.667
Geez, I'm not giving you any candy!

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:31.625
You mean it?

00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:36.083
This is the <i>real </i>Halloween.
Isn't it, Miss Tsugumi?

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:39.542
Miss Tsugumi?

00:03:41.625 --> 00:03:43.125
It can't be...

00:03:45.417 --> 00:03:47.792
It can't be. It can't be.

00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:51.333
I'm going back home!

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:54.833
Huh? Hold on. Miss Tsugumi...?

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:55.833
Come on...

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:57.792
Miss Tsugumi, what's the matter?

00:03:57.792 --> 00:03:59.417
Please, calm down.

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:01.292
"Pochi was in an accident..."

00:04:01.292 --> 00:04:02.292
"They operated on him, but..."

00:04:02.292 --> 00:04:03.667
"...not going to make it."

00:04:05.708 --> 00:04:08.917
Geez, why won't it open?!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.667
Why?

00:04:26.792 --> 00:04:29.792
"The Beginning of the Nightmare!"

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:43.375
Miss Tsugumi, I made you some rice balls.
Would you like to try them?

00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:44.708
Don't want any right now.

00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:48.250
You might settle down if you
have something in your stomach.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.542
I'll leave them right here.

00:04:56.583 --> 00:04:58.083
I'm home!

00:04:58.083 --> 00:05:00.625
I just bought my Halloween costume.

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:01.375
Huh?

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:05.292
A-ha! Leave it to you, Tsugumi!
Very skillfully done.

00:05:05.292 --> 00:05:07.750
Geez, I wish you could be my bride!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.625
Miss Meme!

00:05:10.625 --> 00:05:12.417
Huh?

00:05:12.417 --> 00:05:14.292
Tsugumi...

00:05:14.292 --> 00:05:17.875
What's the matter? Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:20.500
How can you forget?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.958
Huh?

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:25.000
How can you forget things so easily?!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:30.625
It's so awful! The sad times,
and the happy times...

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:33.958
And when it comes to me,
you forget everything right away!

00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:36.042
Meme, you dummy!

00:05:38.042 --> 00:05:39.833
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:46.375
I've forgotten something else that's important.

00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:49.792
And I hurt you, Tsugumi.

00:05:49.792 --> 00:05:51.833
I'm sorry.

00:05:56.833 --> 00:05:58.917
Miss Meme...

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:11.958
I can make something as simple
as stew now by myself, too.

00:06:11.958 --> 00:06:13.667
It's good.

00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:18.167
Ah, Miss Meme!

00:06:18.167 --> 00:06:21.167
Hurry and eat, or it will get cold.

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:24.708
I'm sorry. I'll eat back in the room.

00:07:02.625 --> 00:07:04.250
Miss Tsugumi...

00:07:11.625 --> 00:07:14.750
I've never seen her act
this restlessly in her sleep.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.708
"Restless" doesn't cover it.

00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:20.250
Sheesh...

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.250
Shouldn't we wake her up and take her back home?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:28.500
No, I'll watch over Miss Meme,
and then report to her what she did.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.250
Miss Tsugumi, you can stay back in our room.

00:07:32.333 --> 00:07:35.292
I don't think I'm going to
get much sleep tonight anyway.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:53.083
I'm just wondering, how far is she going?

00:08:11.792 --> 00:08:13.875
That's the same room as before.

00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:17.042
Could she be dreaming
about coming here that one time?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.625
Oh! Why does Miss Meme have a key?

00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:27.417
She shouldn't go in there without permission.

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:47.708
Miss Meme, what are you doing?!

00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:51.667
Please wake up!
You're not supposed to be in here!

00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:53.833
Come on, Miss Meme!

00:08:53.833 --> 00:08:55.917
Miss Meme!

00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:01.583
--What's going on?
--It's so late.

00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:05.833
Akane! And Clay!

00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:08.167
What are <i>you two </i>doing here?

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:09.958
Sid-<i>sensei </i>called us in.

00:09:09.958 --> 00:09:12.333
We're helping him with some late-night overtime.

00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:14.333
At this hour?

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:20.458
Miss Meme!

00:09:20.458 --> 00:09:21.792
Are you all right?!

00:09:21.792 --> 00:09:23.542
Ow-w...

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.000
Huh?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:30.208
Where are we? What's going on?

00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:32.292
Tatane, are you okay?

00:09:32.292 --> 00:09:33.375
Yes.

00:09:33.375 --> 00:09:36.042
The research room is a real mess, huh?

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:39.083
Is this... something<i> I </i>did?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.792
I hate to do this,

00:09:45.792 --> 00:09:48.542
but would you come with me
so I can report it to Sid-<i>sensei</i>?

00:09:48.542 --> 00:09:52.667
--Miss Meme was just walking in her sleep--
--All right.

00:09:52.667 --> 00:09:55.167
Okay, Clay, you see the other two home.

00:09:55.167 --> 00:09:56.375
Yeah.

00:09:56.375 --> 00:09:58.208
Let's go, Tatane.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.000
Thank you very much.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.458
Sure.

00:10:10.417 --> 00:10:12.583
Hey...

00:10:12.583 --> 00:10:16.792
I hate to ask, but could you
bring Tatane a change of clothes?

00:10:16.792 --> 00:10:19.250
--Huh?
--What do you mean?

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.000
She may not be able to come home right away.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.750
Huh? I know she shouldn't have
gone in the room without asking,

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.583
--but that's a far cry from...
--I can't explain everything.

00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:31.708
You'll have to ask Sid-<i>sensei</i>.

00:10:39.583 --> 00:10:41.708
Get in touch with Dr. Stein,

00:10:41.708 --> 00:10:44.250
and request that he examine Tatane immediately.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.375
Right.

00:10:45.375 --> 00:10:47.792
Have you found out how she
got access to the research room key?

00:10:47.792 --> 00:10:49.292
No, I'll hurry on that.

00:10:49.292 --> 00:10:51.083
When we follow this invaluable thread back,

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:53.833
I'm sure it will bring us to Shaula.

00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:55.750
I am a persistent man.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.500
Sid-<i>sensei</i>...

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:01.875
Meme Tatane's two roommates
are asking to see you.

00:11:02.625 --> 00:11:04.000
All right.

00:11:07.667 --> 00:11:11.792
Are you saying that Miss Meme
is friends with a witch?!

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:15.625
Take it easy. It's true,
there can be little doubt that Tatane

00:11:15.625 --> 00:11:19.750
was caught stealing information.
Solid proof should turn up soon.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:20.875
That's not true!

00:11:20.875 --> 00:11:23.042
It can't be...

00:11:23.042 --> 00:11:25.500
This is still just supposition,

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.833
but there's a chance that
Tatane is being controlled by a witch.

00:11:28.833 --> 00:11:31.583
Huh? What do you mean?

00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:35.500
It's probably the same culprit as
the one behind the multiple cases

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.292
of the highly abnormal Traitors,
and the Eternal Feather incident.

00:11:39.292 --> 00:11:41.750
Shaula Gorgon.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:45.250
Her mind control works by
toxins and some kind of suggestion.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:48.000
Then, Miss Meme is one
of her victims, too, isn't she?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:52.250
In Tatane's case, there's a
unique aspect not found in the others.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.917
Tatane doesn't show any symptoms
of insomnia or loss of emotions

00:11:54.917 --> 00:11:57.917
that we've seen in cases up to now.

00:11:57.917 --> 00:11:59.667
Considering her behavior last night,

00:11:59.667 --> 00:12:02.333
as well as the normal side effect
of her memory blockage,

00:12:02.333 --> 00:12:04.667
I believe she is under the influence

00:12:04.667 --> 00:12:06.875
of an even more powerful mind control.

00:12:06.875 --> 00:12:07.958
Huh?

00:12:07.958 --> 00:12:10.292
So, until she has undergone
an extensive examination...

00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:11.708
You mean...

00:12:11.708 --> 00:12:16.292
...the reason Meme is so forgetful...
is because of witch hypnosis?

00:12:16.292 --> 00:12:18.042
I can't say for sure, but...

00:12:22.292 --> 00:12:24.250
Where is Miss Meme now?

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:28.000
Best that you not know. It's too
dangerous for NOT students like you.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.750
All the more reason! Miss Meme is in NOT, too!

00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:36.333
Tatane is in the custody of DWMA.

00:12:36.333 --> 00:12:39.625
We're done here. If I find
out anything, I'll be in touch.

00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:41.708
Sid-<i>sensei</i>!

00:12:49.042 --> 00:12:51.875
I'm sorry, Meme.

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:54.083
Are you stupid?

00:12:54.083 --> 00:12:57.042
That is not Miss Meme.

00:12:57.042 --> 00:12:59.292
No, but...

00:12:59.292 --> 00:13:02.583
Miss Tsugumi, if you were hypnotized by a witch

00:13:02.583 --> 00:13:06.750
and made to do bad things...
and had your freedom taken from you,

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:11.792
would you want your partner
to apologize to a pumpkin?

00:13:11.792 --> 00:13:15.417
I wouldn't want a partner who would do that.

00:13:15.417 --> 00:13:17.125
Then what <i>should </i>we--

00:13:19.542 --> 00:13:25.292
I don't know what we should do, either.

00:13:25.292 --> 00:13:26.917
Miss Anya...

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:37.208
It really is a shame what happened to Pochi.

00:13:37.208 --> 00:13:41.125
Yes.

00:13:41.125 --> 00:13:43.583
I'm going to go get a little exercise.

00:14:04.125 --> 00:14:06.083
Huh? A bat?!

00:14:06.792 --> 00:14:08.750
Please, do something about it, Miss Tsugumi!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.292
I can't!

00:14:11.292 --> 00:14:13.667
There! Now, Miss Tsugumi! Hurry!

00:14:13.667 --> 00:14:17.458
Hurry?! Huh? Miss Anya, look there!

00:14:18.333 --> 00:14:20.500
A messenger bat?

00:14:25.042 --> 00:14:27.208
"Tsugumi, Anya, I'm scared.
I want to see you both. --Meme"

00:14:27.208 --> 00:14:28.375
This is...

00:14:28.375 --> 00:14:30.667
...a letter from Meme!

00:14:37.667 --> 00:14:39.833
How is Tatane behaving?

00:14:39.833 --> 00:14:42.708
She is calm right now.

00:14:42.708 --> 00:14:49.000
I am reluctant to do this--to use
Tatane as bait to draw Shaula in.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.542
According to Stein's report,

00:14:50.542 --> 00:14:54.500
he detected a mysterious
component within Tatane's blood.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.875
Until this case has been settled,

00:14:56.875 --> 00:15:00.833
Tatane is still in danger.
For now, stay focused on the mission.

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:02.333
Right.

00:15:02.333 --> 00:15:05.042
We should worry more about Tatane's safety

00:15:05.042 --> 00:15:06.875
than capturing Shaula, right?

00:15:06.875 --> 00:15:08.208
Of course.

00:15:08.208 --> 00:15:10.042
Someone's coming in the back way.

00:15:10.042 --> 00:15:14.250
Two of them. Girls, one wearing a DWMA uniform.

00:15:20.417 --> 00:15:22.208
There's no one here, huh?

00:15:22.208 --> 00:15:23.708
Mm-mm.

00:15:27.667 --> 00:15:29.542
Miss Tsugumi, over there!

00:15:33.958 --> 00:15:35.292
Meme?

00:15:35.292 --> 00:15:36.583
Tsugumi?!

00:15:36.583 --> 00:15:37.625
Meme!

00:15:37.625 --> 00:15:38.583
Miss Meme!

00:15:38.583 --> 00:15:42.083
You came here!

00:15:42.083 --> 00:15:45.667
Tsugumi... Miss Anya...

00:15:45.667 --> 00:15:47.500
Are you getting enough to eat?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.250
Yes.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.208
They're not doing anything awful to you, right?

00:15:50.208 --> 00:15:52.042
Right.

00:15:54.125 --> 00:15:56.083
Meme...

00:15:56.083 --> 00:15:58.792
I'm sorry, Meme.

00:15:58.792 --> 00:16:04.083
I had no idea. I said such terrible things.

00:16:04.083 --> 00:16:10.708
Mm-mm... so did I.
Thank goodness you came, Tsugumi.

00:16:10.708 --> 00:16:12.000
Mm-hmm.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.583
Miss Tsugumi!

00:16:15.083 --> 00:16:16.333
Mm-hmm!

00:16:18.208 --> 00:16:20.250
Meme, stand back!

00:16:24.625 --> 00:16:26.250
Miss Meme!

00:16:32.833 --> 00:16:36.125
You saved me the trouble of opening it myself.

00:16:36.125 --> 00:16:37.917
Meme...?

00:16:37.917 --> 00:16:40.417
Thank you, Tsugumi.

00:16:45.625 --> 00:16:47.750
Stop this!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.458
I won't be playing around this time.

00:16:52.625 --> 00:16:54.125
You're too slow!

00:17:08.542 --> 00:17:10.417
Unless you want to die, change into a weapon!

00:17:10.417 --> 00:17:11.917
Eh?!

00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:25.292
Surround and apprehend her!

00:17:25.292 --> 00:17:28.667
Here's your dear student. Be sure to catch her!

00:17:36.875 --> 00:17:39.958
Sniper team, what is the target's location?!

00:17:39.958 --> 00:17:42.750
Sniper team, what's wrong?! Respond!

00:17:45.333 --> 00:17:48.583
Target located!
She's heading north out of B Area.

00:17:51.208 --> 00:17:53.708
Now, open your eyes...

00:17:58.042 --> 00:17:59.292
Ee-yow!

00:17:59.292 --> 00:18:01.875
Miss Tsugumi! Are you all right?!

00:18:01.875 --> 00:18:04.125
Mm-hmm. What about <i>you</i>, Miss Anya?

00:18:04.125 --> 00:18:07.708
I can handle this just fine.
Let's go after Miss Meme!

00:18:07.708 --> 00:18:08.708
Right!

00:18:18.833 --> 00:18:21.000
Shaula Gorgon, right?

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:25.000
Sid-<i>sensei,</i>

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.417
you want me to return this body, right?

00:18:35.417 --> 00:18:37.833
Clay, Akane, take over here!

00:18:37.833 --> 00:18:39.417
--Right!
--Right!

00:18:39.417 --> 00:18:42.167
We're taking Tatane back.

00:18:42.167 --> 00:18:44.792
Akane, help me...

00:18:49.333 --> 00:18:53.792
What's the matter?
Show me some of your killer moves!

00:18:56.625 --> 00:18:59.583
All right, surround her
and keep her from moving!

00:19:03.208 --> 00:19:05.000
Kill each other.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:20.750
I'd expect no less, Sid Barret.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:24.708
How about releasing your
Soul Protect and using your magic?

00:19:25.542 --> 00:19:27.375
There's no need for that.

00:19:35.417 --> 00:19:37.458
Oh, no! Tatane!

00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:46.667
You are blessed with some
outstanding students, Sid-<i>sensei.</i>

00:19:48.708 --> 00:19:51.125
You are at risk.

00:19:51.125 --> 00:19:54.667
What I need are not outstanding subordinates.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:58.667
Just obedient soldiers.

00:20:03.625 --> 00:20:04.917
What was that?!

00:20:28.042 --> 00:20:29.583
Meme?

00:20:31.083 --> 00:20:32.708
No way...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.417
This can't be!

00:20:35.417 --> 00:20:37.375
Sid-<i>sensei</i>!

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.208
How is Sid-<i>sensei</i>?

00:21:01.958 --> 00:21:05.542
Why? What's going on here?

00:21:08.583 --> 00:21:11.292
Princess Anastasia Yngling...

00:21:12.792 --> 00:21:16.458
I will arrange for someone to come
get you. Please return home at once.

00:21:16.458 --> 00:21:20.583
Anastasia Yngling? Princess?

00:21:20.583 --> 00:21:22.625
Why?

00:21:22.625 --> 00:21:25.167
There is an agreement in
place with your country, Princess,

00:21:25.167 --> 00:21:26.833
such that if any danger were to befall you,

00:21:26.833 --> 00:21:29.333
we would return you to your land at once.

00:21:29.333 --> 00:21:31.333
Sid said that if anything happened to him,

00:21:31.333 --> 00:21:33.875
we should send you home at our discretion.

00:21:33.875 --> 00:21:35.500
Why you two?!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:40.958
We are EAT class students,
and work for Central Intelligence.

00:21:40.958 --> 00:21:42.250
The reason we were in NOT

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.917
was to secretly serve as
your bodyguards, Princess.

00:21:44.917 --> 00:21:46.583
You mean...

00:21:46.583 --> 00:21:49.167
Tell me, what's going on?

00:21:50.625 --> 00:21:51.458
Come...

00:21:51.458 --> 00:21:55.000
Please wait! At a time like this,
I cannot just go home alone,

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.167
leaving my partner behind!

00:21:57.167 --> 00:22:00.333
You two are not yet formally partners.

00:22:00.333 --> 00:22:01.458
No, but still...

00:22:01.458 --> 00:22:03.458
Sid-<i>sensei </i>is dead!

00:22:03.458 --> 00:22:07.458
We can't afford to occupy ourselves
with your goofing around anymore!

00:22:12.917 --> 00:22:15.417
We'll walk you back to DWMA.

00:22:15.417 --> 00:22:17.750
It will be dangerous,
so until your escort arrives,

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.708
please refrain from going outside.

00:22:26.125 --> 00:22:27.500
Miss Anya!

00:22:30.125 --> 00:22:33.000
Tell me, what's going on?!

00:22:47.542 --> 00:22:51.708
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:22:51.708 --> 00:22:58.625
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:23:15.375 --> 00:23:19.542
<i>Our shadows stretch along the pavement</i>

00:23:19.542 --> 00:23:23.542
<i>coming together, then apart, then together</i>

00:23:23.542 --> 00:23:31.875
<i>What do I say when the road home ends?</i>

00:23:31.875 --> 00:23:36.042
<i>You are not alone. Nope, right nearby,</i>

00:23:36.042 --> 00:23:40.167
<i>there are eyes looking back at you</i>

00:23:40.167 --> 00:23:44.292
<i>And just like a miracle,</i>

00:23:44.292 --> 00:23:48.042
<i>they can turn even failures into laughter</i>

00:23:48.042 --> 00:23:52.167
<i>Thank you for a fun day</i>

00:23:52.167 --> 00:23:56.500
<i>Let's do it again tomorrow</i>

00:23:56.500 --> 00:24:00.583
<i>We'll open a brand-new door</i>

00:24:00.583 --> 00:24:04.750
<i>chasing after dreams and love</i>

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:10.375
<i>and those nameless feelings, too</i>

00:24:18.375 --> 00:24:20.917
As we fall to pieces,
we are beset by different trials.

00:24:20.917 --> 00:24:23.000
However, we won't stand around doing nothing!

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:26.042
No matter what I have to do,
I will come back to you, Miss Tsugumi!

00:24:26.042 --> 00:24:29.167
Tsugumi... Miss Anya... help me...

00:24:29.167 --> 00:24:29.583
"Next time: Their Various Resolves!"

00:24:29.583 --> 00:24:32.107
"Next time: Their Various Resolves!"
Sit tight, Miss Meme!
